{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CapyBash</strong> gives you the chance to relax with your friends. You along with up to 3 friends can compete against each other. It's a side-view platformer game where you must collect as many points as possible with cute capybaras to come out on top when time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Various Game Modes</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Basic Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Try to kill as many enemies as possible and keep your head safe.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/72e0f7a653fe6315530ea3e64564b6e4.poster.avif?t=1758738757\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/72e0f7a653fe6315530ea3e64564b6e4.webm?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/72e0f7a653fe6315530ea3e64564b6e4.mp4?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gold Rush</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>There is 1 gold coin on the track at all times.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The player who gets it earns 3 points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/fff2eed37d44463be494bb4674b072a2.poster.avif?t=1758738757\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/fff2eed37d44463be494bb4674b072a2.webm?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/fff2eed37d44463be494bb4674b072a2.mp4?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Capture the Flag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Own the flag as long as possible to get valuable points.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Every 2 seconds, you get 1 point.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/8be7fae8e767e549d6ac3d11ebefe149.poster.avif?t=1758738757\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/8be7fae8e767e549d6ac3d11ebefe149.webm?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/8be7fae8e767e549d6ac3d11ebefe149.mp4?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Floor is Lava</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>It is very simple; if you fall into it, you die after a few seconds.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Your reward is -1 point, so be very careful where you step.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/79d4cbf32a98a2f5c342b8ca7b7dd824.poster.avif?t=1758738757\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/79d4cbf32a98a2f5c342b8ca7b7dd824.webm?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/79d4cbf32a98a2f5c342b8ca7b7dd824.mp4?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Simple Rules</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>-Score as many points as possible by jumping on your opponent's head</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-By killing your enemy, you gain 1 point</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-When time is up, the player with the most points wins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-If time is up and the score is tied, the game continues</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Become a capybara and defeat your friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/f2245016d3737233b1827614d8888292.poster.avif?t=1758738757\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/f2245016d3737233b1827614d8888292.webm?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326980/extras/f2245016d3737233b1827614d8888292.mp4?t=1758738757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JOIN US ON DISCORD!</strong></h2><p class=\"b